#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md:5
msgid ""
"This page describes the analyzed source snapshot. Its findings and "
"limitations are not a certification of the current branch."
msgstr ""
"Esta página describe la instantánea analizada del código fuente. Sus "
"hallazgos y limitaciones no certifican la rama actual."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md:8
msgid ""
"Cadrumo is a local-first Spanish tax workbench for an operator managing a"
" taxpayer profile, financial source records, Modelo calculations, local "
"filing artefacts and observed AEAT state. The principal interface is a "
"declarative Typer CLI. An installed Textual workbench and a bounded MCP "
"harness use the same profile-bound runtime operations; agent personas and"
" skills are guidance, not an independent filing authority. The project "
"ships substantial dated registry and corpus material, but a bundled "
"layout, a calculated result, a local `PRESENTADO` record and an AEAT-"
"confirmed submission are different claims. CLI graph "
"(`src/cadrumo/entrypoints/cli/command_graph.py`), runtime "
"(`src/cadrumo/entrypoints/runtime/operation_authority.py`), [knowledge "
"inventory](../topics/bundled-knowledge-and-localization.md), [interface "
"analysis](../articles/158-cli-contracts-execution-projection-diagnostics-"
"and-evidence-notices.md)."
msgstr ""
"Cadrumo es un entorno de trabajo tributario español que prioriza el "
"funcionamiento local para un operador que gestiona un perfil de "
"contribuyente, registros financieros de origen, cálculos de modelos, "
"artefactos locales de declaración y estado observado de la AEAT. La "
"interfaz principal es una CLI declarativa de Typer. Un entorno instalado "
"de Textual y una infraestructura MCP acotada utilizan las mismas "
"operaciones del entorno de ejecución vinculadas al perfil; los perfiles y"
" habilidades de agentes son orientación, no autoridad independiente de "
"presentación. El proyecto incluye abundante material fechado de registro "
"y corpus, pero un diseño incluido, un resultado calculado, un registro "
"local `PRESENTADO` y una presentación confirmada por la AEAT son "
"afirmaciones distintas. Grafo de CLI "
"(`src/cadrumo/entrypoints/cli/command_graph.py`), entorno de ejecución "
"(`src/cadrumo/entrypoints/runtime/operation_authority.py`), [inventario "
"de conocimiento](../topics/bundled-knowledge-and-localization.md), "
"[análisis de interfaces](../articles/158-cli-contracts-execution-"
"projection-diagnostics-and-evidence-notices.md)."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md:10
msgid ""
"**Status vocabulary.** “Implemented” below means a concrete source path "
"and typed contract were found in the checked-in snapshot; it does not "
"mean the path was executed in this review. “Conditional” means the path "
"depends on a profile, provider, registry grade, evidence, consent, or "
"populated producer facts. “Refused” names a visible deliberate stop. "
"“Unverified” describes current law, live portal success, platform "
"behavior, or other claims static inspection cannot establish. A parser "
"accepting a document is not a canonical invoice; a formula yielding a "
"value is not export readiness; an export is a local file; a remote read "
"is an observation; an attempted submission would be a separate effect; "
"and a confirmed filing needs matched external evidence. "
"[Draft/export](../topics/filing-and-live-state.md), [filing "
"lifecycle](../topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md), "
"receipt gate "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/filed_observation_persistence.py`), "
"[analysis](../articles/064-filed-declaration-capture-evidence-enrollment-"
"and-history-sweep.md)."
msgstr ""
"**Vocabulario de estados.** «Implementado» significa a continuación que "
"se encontraron una ruta concreta de código y un contrato tipado en la "
"instantánea versionada; no significa que la ruta se ejecutara en esta "
"revisión. «Condicional» significa que la ruta depende de un perfil, "
"proveedor, grado del registro, evidencias, consentimiento o datos de "
"productor rellenados. «Rechazado» identifica una parada deliberada "
"visible. «Sin verificar» describe legislación vigente, éxito del portal "
"en vivo, comportamiento de plataforma u otras afirmaciones que la "
"inspección estática no puede acreditar. Que un analizador acepte un "
"documento no lo convierte en una factura canónica; que una fórmula "
"produzca un valor no implica preparación para exportar; una exportación "
"es un archivo local; una lectura remota es una observación; un intento de"
" presentación sería un efecto separado; y una presentación confirmada "
"necesita evidencias externas coincidentes. [Borrador y "
"exportación](../topics/filing-and-live-state.md), [ciclo de vida de "
"presentación](../topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md), "
"control de justificantes "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/filed_observation_persistence.py`), "
"[análisis](../articles/064-filed-declaration-capture-evidence-enrollment-"
"and-history-sweep.md)."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid "Capability and actor"
msgstr "Capacidad y actor"

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid "Trigger, inputs and behavior"
msgstr "Desencadenante, entradas y comportamiento"

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid "Output and status"
msgstr "Salida y estado"

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid "Boundary or limit; evidence"
msgstr "Frontera o límite; pruebas"

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid "**Profile setup and custody** — human operator"
msgstr "**Configuración y custodia de perfiles** — operador humano"

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Create/select/login, wizard edit, recovery, bundle export or deletion "
"using profile facts, password proof and revision/digest baselines. "
"Profile schemas validate full records and preserve explicit clears."
msgstr ""
"Crear, seleccionar e iniciar sesión, editar con el asistente, recuperar, "
"exportar paquetes o eliminar mediante datos del perfil, prueba de "
"contraseña y bases de revisión y resumen. Los esquemas de perfiles "
"validan registros completos y conservan borrados explícitos."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Encrypted profile record, selected session, masked overview, recovery or "
"export receipt. **Implemented; conditional** on proof and current "
"custody."
msgstr ""
"Registro cifrado del perfil, sesión seleccionada, panorámica enmascarada,"
" recibo de recuperación o exportación. **Implementado; condicional** a la"
" prueba y custodia actual."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"One-invocation authentication does not silently select a new default "
"profile. Deletion is local and reports retained external state; no remote"
" erasure claim. [Profile operations](../topics/operations-profiles-and-"
"workflows.md), login "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/login_session.py`), "
"[analysis](../articles/104-profile-login-maintenance-operations-and-"
"history.md)."
msgstr ""
"La autenticación para una invocación no selecciona silenciosamente un "
"nuevo perfil predeterminado. La eliminación es local e informa del estado"
" externo conservado; no afirma borrado remoto. [Operaciones de "
"perfiles](../topics/operations-profiles-and-workflows.md), inicio de "
"sesión (`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/login_session.py`), "
"[análisis](../articles/104-profile-login-maintenance-operations-and-"
"history.md)."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid "**Ledger and bank imports** — bookkeeper/operator"
msgstr "**Libro contable e importaciones bancarias** — contable u operador"

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Import CSV, OFX/QFX, XLS/XLSX or named provider rows; "
"add/edit/classify/split/merge transactions and link evidence. Dry-run and"
" revision checks distinguish duplicate, deferred and refused rows."
msgstr ""
"Importar CSV, OFX/QFX, XLS/XLSX o filas de proveedores identificados; "
"añadir, editar, clasificar, dividir y fusionar transacciones y vincular "
"evidencias. La simulación y las comprobaciones de revisión distinguen "
"filas duplicadas, aplazadas y rechazadas."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Bucket-owned transaction/event records, diagnostics and readiness views. "
"**Implemented; conditional** on valid currency/identity/source facts."
msgstr ""
"Registros de transacciones y eventos propios del contenedor, diagnósticos"
" y vistas de preparación. **Implementado; condicional** a datos válidos "
"de moneda, identidad y origen."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Unknown FX does not become EUR, finalized calculation references block "
"fact changes, and a file changing after staging can affect a separately "
"reopened original-file hash. [Ledger](../topics/ledger-invoices-and-"
"registers.md), import "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/ledger/actions_import.py`), "
"[analysis](../articles/052-manual-ledger-services-evidence-operations-"
"and-batch-ingestion.md)."
msgstr ""
"Un cambio de divisas desconocido no se convierte en EUR, las referencias "
"de cálculos finalizados bloquean cambios de datos y un archivo modificado"
" después de prepararse puede afectar a un hash del archivo original "
"reabierto por separado. [Libro contable](../topics/ledger-invoices-and-"
"registers.md), importación "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/ledger/actions_import.py`), "
"[análisis](../articles/052-manual-ledger-services-evidence-operations-"
"and-batch-ingestion.md)."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid "**Invoice intake and evidence review** — bookkeeper/reviewer"
msgstr "**Recepción de facturas y revisión de evidencias** — contable o revisor"

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Import canonical invoice rows or single structured CII/UBL/Facturae; "
"attach a PDF/image, run deterministic or consented model extraction, "
"review every blocking finding, and confirm against source/review digests."
msgstr ""
"Importar filas canónicas de facturas o facturas individuales "
"estructuradas CII/UBL/Facturae; adjuntar un PDF o imagen, ejecutar "
"extracción determinista o mediante modelo con consentimiento, revisar "
"cada hallazgo bloqueante y confirmar frente a resúmenes de origen y "
"revisión."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Content-addressed invoice catalogue and reciprocal ledger links; lower-"
"confidence evidence/draft before confirmation. **Implemented; "
"conditional** on parsable input and review."
msgstr ""
"Catálogo de facturas direccionado por contenido y vínculos recíprocos con"
" el libro contable; evidencia o borrador de menor confianza antes de "
"confirmar. **Implementado; condicional** a una entrada analizable y "
"revisión."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"SII/VERI*FACTU collection formats are not silently treated as one "
"invoice. Model output remains a proposal; off-host bytes require per-call"
" consent and source-hash binding. [Evidence path](../topics/ledger-"
"invoices-and-registers.md), consent operation "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/ledger/invoice_evidence_extract_operation.py`),"
" [analysis](../articles/055-evidence-custody-review-and-ingestion-"
"operations.md)."
msgstr ""
"Los formatos de colecciones SII/VERI*FACTU no se tratan silenciosamente "
"como una factura. La salida del modelo sigue siendo una propuesta; los "
"bytes fuera del equipo requieren consentimiento por llamada y vinculación"
" al hash de origen. [Ruta de evidencias](../topics/ledger-invoices-and-"
"registers.md), operación de consentimiento "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/ledger/invoice_evidence_extract_operation.py`),"
" [análisis](../articles/055-evidence-custody-review-and-ingestion-"
"operations.md)."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid "**Financial registers and source aggregation** — operator/preparer"
msgstr "**Registros financieros y agregación de fuentes** — operador o preparador"

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Maintain inventory, withholding, IVA prorrata and other local registers; "
"select dated profile, transaction, invoice and prior-filing sources for a"
" target Modelo revision."
msgstr ""
"Mantener inventario, retenciones, prorrata de IVA y otros registros "
"locales; seleccionar fuentes fechadas de perfil, transacciones, facturas "
"y declaraciones anteriores para una revisión de modelo de destino."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Typed scalar/row/relationship inputs with provenance, unresolved values "
"and diagnostics. **Implemented with model-specific coverage.**"
msgstr ""
"Entradas tipadas escalares, de filas y relaciones con procedencia, "
"valores sin resolver y diagnósticos. **Implementado con cobertura "
"específica por modelo.**"

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"A populated register or parser is not a filing-grade calculation; "
"competing owners and incomplete source evidence can refuse. "
"[Aggregation](../topics/aggregation-and-calculation-services.md), source "
"mesh (`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/source_mesh.py`), "
"[analysis](../articles/031-aggregation-iva-screening-and-fiscal-"
"evidence.md)."
msgstr ""
"Un registro rellenado o un analizador no es un cálculo apto para "
"declaración; los titulares en competencia y las evidencias de origen "
"incompletas pueden provocar rechazo. [Agregación](../topics/aggregation-"
"and-calculation-services.md), malla de fuentes "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/aggregation/source_mesh.py`), "
"[análisis](../articles/031-aggregation-iva-screening-and-fiscal-"
"evidence.md)."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid "**Modelo discovery, calculation and review** — preparer"
msgstr "**Descubrimiento, cálculo y revisión de modelos** — preparador"

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Discover models, casillas, formulas, legal references and needed sources;"
" address a model/year/period work unit; run pinned formula evaluation "
"with profile/ledger/invoice/operator inputs; edit typed scalar/binding "
"values."
msgstr ""
"Descubrir modelos, casillas, fórmulas, referencias legales y fuentes "
"necesarias; dirigirse a una unidad de trabajo de modelo, ejercicio y "
"período; ejecutar evaluación fijada de fórmulas con entradas del perfil, "
"libro contable, facturas y operador; editar valores tipados escalares y "
"de vinculaciones."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Content-addressed BORRADOR revision, operands, provenance, work form and "
"advisories. **Implemented; conditional** on supported revision and "
"complete inputs."
msgstr ""
"Revisión BORRADOR direccionada por contenido, operandos, procedencia, "
"formulario de trabajo y avisos. **Implementado; condicional** a revisión "
"admitida y entradas completas."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Static workspace mode measures registry schema only. Active edit "
"execution refuses row intents, and some model-specific paths explicitly "
"stop for unsettled authority. [Work lifecycle](../topics/modelo-work-and-"
"revision-lifecycle-part-1.md), [workbench](../topics/modelo-work-and-"
"revision-lifecycle-part-2.md), calculation "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_actions.py`), "
"[analysis](../articles/067-modelo-calculation-preparation-edits-and-"
"evidence-gates.md)."
msgstr ""
"El modo estático del espacio de trabajo solo mide el esquema del "
"registro. La ejecución activa de ediciones rechaza intenciones de filas y"
" algunas rutas específicas de modelos se detienen expresamente por "
"autoridad sin resolver. [Ciclo de vida del trabajo](../topics/modelo-"
"work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md), [entorno de trabajo](../topics"
"/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-2.md), cálculo "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/calculation_actions.py`), "
"[análisis](../articles/067-modelo-calculation-preparation-edits-and-"
"evidence-gates.md)."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid "**Verification and local filing readiness** — preparer/reviewer"
msgstr ""
"**Verificación y preparación para presentación local** — preparador o "
"revisor"

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Recheck exact revision, pinned filing-grade registry, required manual "
"inputs, ledger drift, wallet/prior-filing conditions and model-specific "
"predicates. Approve only a current draft; local `work file` records the "
"verified result."
msgstr ""
"Volver a comprobar revisión exacta, registro fijado apto para "
"declaración, entradas manuales obligatorias, divergencias contables, "
"condiciones de cartera y declaraciones previas y predicados específicos "
"del modelo. Aprobar solo un borrador actual; `work file` local registra "
"el resultado verificado."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Separate verification report and local `PRESENTADO` revision whose AEAT "
"status starts `PENDIENTE`. **Implemented; conditional** on all gates."
msgstr ""
"Informe separado de verificación y revisión local `PRESENTADO` cuyo "
"estado ante la AEAT empieza como `PENDIENTE`. **Implementado; "
"condicional** a todos los controles."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Modelo 123 captured-withholding work refuses through export pending a "
"count rule; selected Modelo 193 settlement rows stop filing/export. A "
"local filing record is not AEAT submission. Verification "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/verification_actions.py`), local record "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/revision_persistence.py`), "
"[analysis](../articles/083-revision-selection-settlement-presentation-"
"and-verification.md)."
msgstr ""
"El trabajo del Modelo 123 con retenciones capturadas se rechaza hasta la "
"exportación mientras se resuelve una regla de recuento; determinadas "
"filas de liquidación del Modelo 193 detienen presentación y exportación. "
"Un registro local de presentación no es presentación ante la AEAT. "
"Verificación (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/verification_actions.py`), "
"registro local "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/revision_persistence.py`), "
"[análisis](../articles/083-revision-selection-settlement-presentation-"
"and-verification.md)."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid "**Official-layout and report export** — preparer/operator"
msgstr "**Exportación de diseños oficiales e informes** — preparador u operador"

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Select pinned fixed-width/XML layout, project typed producer facts, "
"enforce parity, write local bytes atomically and read back representable "
"casillas. Quickfile sequences readiness, calculation, verification and "
"local export. Separate PDF/CSV calculation reports and Google/offline "
"workbooks serve review."
msgstr ""
"Seleccionar un diseño fijado de ancho fijo o XML, proyectar datos tipados"
" del productor, imponer correspondencia, escribir bytes locales "
"atómicamente y volver a leer casillas representables. Quickfile encadena "
"preparación, cálculo, verificación y exportación local. Informes "
"separados de cálculo PDF/CSV y libros de Google o sin conexión sirven "
"para revisión."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Local BOE/XML artifact with size/digest/verification grade, or "
"nonofficial calculation/workbook output. **Implemented; conditional** on "
"model producer coverage."
msgstr ""
"Artefacto local BOE/XML con tamaño, resumen y grado de verificación, o "
"salida no oficial de cálculo o libro. **Implementado; condicional** a "
"cobertura de productores del modelo."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"M202 refuses specified unsupported producer fields; M200 repeated rows "
"remain operator supplied. Google Sheets can be a remote writer but is not"
" AEAT. Quickfile ends at export. [Export](../topics/filing-and-live-"
"state.md), quickfile (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/quickfile.py`), "
"M202 (`src/cadrumo/application/filing/producer_snapshot.py`), "
"[analysis](../articles/047-filing-producer-facts-repeated-record-"
"projection-and-runtime-schema.md)."
msgstr ""
"M202 rechaza campos de productor especificados no admitidos; las filas "
"repetidas de M200 siguen siendo aportadas por el operador. Google Sheets "
"puede ser un escritor remoto, pero no es la AEAT. Quickfile termina en "
"exportación. [Exportación](../topics/filing-and-live-state.md), quickfile"
" (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/quickfile.py`), M202 "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/filing/producer_snapshot.py`), "
"[análisis](../articles/047-filing-producer-facts-repeated-record-"
"projection-and-runtime-schema.md)."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid "**AEAT authentication and observation** — authenticated operator"
msgstr "**Autenticación y observación de la AEAT** — operador autenticado"

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Configure certificate or Cl@ve, establish a verified session and perform "
"guarded reads of censo, Borrador 100, filed registers/history, IVA "
"wallet, notifications, expedientes and identity-verification surfaces."
msgstr ""
"Configurar certificado o Cl@ve, establecer una sesión verificada y "
"realizar lecturas protegidas de censo, Borrador 100, registros e "
"historial de declaraciones, cartera de IVA, notificaciones, expedientes y"
" superficies de verificación de identidad."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Bucket-bound captured snapshots with attempted/completed/refused/empty "
"counts and provenance. **Implemented; conditional** on provider, session "
"and live site behavior."
msgstr ""
"Instantáneas capturadas vinculadas al contenedor con recuentos "
"intentados, completados, rechazados y vacíos y procedencia. "
"**Implementado; condicional** al proveedor, sesión y comportamiento del "
"sitio en vivo."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"A bulk dry run can still read AEAT while avoiding local evidence writes. "
"Notification-document fetch requires prior read state; it is not a "
"comparecencia action. Live success was **unverified**. [Live "
"state](../topics/filing-and-live-state.md), read guard "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/session.py`), [analysis](../articles/063"
"-live-snapshots-and-filed-data-capture-operations.md)."
msgstr ""
"Una simulación masiva puede seguir leyendo la AEAT mientras evita "
"escrituras locales de evidencias. La obtención de documentos de "
"notificación exige estado de lectura previo; no es una acción de "
"comparecencia. El éxito en vivo quedó **sin verificar**. [Estado en "
"vivo](../topics/filing-and-live-state.md), control de lectura "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/session.py`), [análisis](../articles/063"
"-live-snapshots-and-filed-data-capture-operations.md)."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid "**Filing evidence and reconciliation** — operator/reviewer"
msgstr "**Evidencias de presentación y conciliación** — operador o revisor"

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Acquire a justificante or filed register observation, validate PDF "
"digest, CSV, model/period/taxpayer and current local record, then compare"
" with pending filing chain."
msgstr ""
"Adquirir un justificante u observación del registro de declaraciones "
"presentadas, validar resumen del PDF, CSV, modelo, período, contribuyente"
" y registro local actual y después comparar con la cadena pendiente de "
"presentación."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Confirmed, discrepant, unavailable or still-pending evidence state. "
"**Implemented; conditional** on matching authenticated observations."
msgstr ""
"Estado de evidencias confirmado, discrepante, no disponible o aún "
"pendiente. **Implementado; condicional** a observaciones autenticadas "
"coincidentes."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"A downloaded PDF or syntactically valid CSV is not confirmation. A "
"pending amendment needs its own later external evidence. "
"[Reconciliation](../topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md),"
" receipt gate "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/filed_observation_persistence.py`), "
"[analysis](../articles/065-iva-receipt-and-notification-evidence-"
"surfaces.md)."
msgstr ""
"Un PDF descargado o un CSV sintácticamente válido no son confirmación. "
"Una rectificación pendiente necesita sus propias evidencias externas "
"posteriores. [Conciliación](../topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-"
"part-1.md), control de justificantes "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/live/filed_observation_persistence.py`), "
"[análisis](../articles/065-iva-receipt-and-notification-evidence-"
"surfaces.md)."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid "**Calendar, Home, review and search** — operator"
msgstr "**Calendario, Inicio, revisión y búsqueda** — operador"

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Combine pinned deadlines, profile applicability, local work and already-"
"loaded observations; rank agenda/backlog, show next actions, review "
"transactions/invoices/drafts, and search admitted workspace snapshots."
msgstr ""
"Combinar plazos fijados, aplicabilidad del perfil, trabajo local y "
"observaciones ya cargadas; ordenar agenda y pendientes, mostrar "
"siguientes acciones, revisar transacciones, facturas y borradores y "
"buscar instantáneas admitidas del espacio de trabajo."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Availability-aware read models, obligation coverage and exact-profile no-"
"effect receipts. **Implemented; conditional** on profile/evidence "
"completeness."
msgstr ""
"Modelos de lectura que tienen en cuenta disponibilidad, cobertura de "
"obligaciones y recibos sin efectos del perfil exacto. **Implementado; "
"condicional** a integridad del perfil y las evidencias."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"An empty window is not “no obligation”; a stale or unavailable source is "
"not a negative finding. Search IDs are process-local, not bookmarks. "
"[Overview](../topics/operations-profiles-and-workflows.md), coverage "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/overview/coverage.py`), "
"[analysis](../articles/093-overview-calendar-filing-evidence-and-"
"readiness-views.md)."
msgstr ""
"Una ventana vacía no significa «ninguna obligación»; una fuente obsoleta "
"o no disponible no es un hallazgo negativo. Los identificadores de "
"búsqueda son locales al proceso, no marcadores. [Panorámica](../topics"
"/operations-profiles-and-workflows.md), cobertura "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/overview/coverage.py`), "
"[análisis](../articles/093-overview-calendar-filing-evidence-and-"
"readiness-views.md)."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid "**Terminal, CLI and agent-assisted work** — human or scoped automation"
msgstr ""
"**Trabajo mediante terminal, CLI y asistencia de agentes** — persona o "
"automatización delimitada"

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Use command graph, Textual Home/Declarations/Ledger/AEAT Sync/Modelo "
"screens, or the 15-tool MCP protocol through the installed runtime. "
"Operations bind exact profile, session, frontend, effect and receipt; "
"agent skills suggest staged review."
msgstr ""
"Utilizar el grafo de comandos, las pantallas de Inicio, Declaraciones, "
"Libro contable, Sincronización con la AEAT y Modelo de Textual o el "
"protocolo MCP de 15 herramientas mediante el entorno de ejecución "
"instalado. Las operaciones vinculan perfil exacto, sesión, interfaz, "
"efecto y recibo; las habilidades de agentes sugieren revisión por etapas."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Typed text/JSON, TUI projections, MCP receipts and uncertain operation "
"IDs. **Implemented; conditional** on eligible session/grant."
msgstr ""
"Texto y JSON tipados, proyecciones TUI, recibos MCP e identificadores de "
"operaciones inciertas. **Implementado; condicional** a sesión o "
"autorización admisible."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"TUI generic modal supports REVIEW but not INPUT/CHOICE; two Ledger "
"review-selection routes say destination pending. Prompt guidance does not"
" grant authority. [Runtime/TUI](../topics/runtime-tui-and-agent-"
"harness.md), modal (`src/cadrumo/entrypoints/tui/operations/modal.py`), "
"[analysis](../articles/182-supervised-operation-modal-and-profile-"
"manager.md)."
msgstr ""
"La ventana modal genérica de TUI admite REVIEW, pero no INPUT/CHOICE; dos"
" rutas de selección de revisión del Libro contable indican destino "
"pendiente. Las instrucciones no conceden autoridad. [Entorno de ejecución"
" y TUI](../topics/runtime-tui-and-agent-harness.md), ventana modal "
"(`src/cadrumo/entrypoints/tui/operations/modal.py`), "
"[análisis](../articles/182-supervised-operation-modal-and-profile-"
"manager.md)."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid "**Archives, storage and diagnostics** — owner/operator"
msgstr "**Archivos, almacenamiento y diagnóstico** — propietario u operador"

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Export encrypted portable bundle or sealed archive, inspect storage, "
"reclaim declared targets, view history/health and opt into bounded "
"telemetry."
msgstr ""
"Exportar un paquete portátil cifrado o archivo sellado, inspeccionar "
"almacenamiento, recuperar espacio de destinos declarados, ver historial y"
" funcionamiento y aceptar telemetría acotada."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Journals, audit events, local artefacts and redacted diagnostic "
"projections. **Implemented; conditional** on proof, consent and adapter "
"durability."
msgstr ""
"Diarios, eventos de auditoría, artefactos locales y proyecciones de "
"diagnóstico con datos ocultados. **Implementado; condicional** a prueba, "
"consentimiento y durabilidad del adaptador."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md
msgid ""
"Cleartext portable export is an explicit local destination choice. "
"Telemetry defaults off; declared retention ages are not automatically "
"enforced cleanup. [Custody](../topics/operations-profiles-and-"
"workflows.md), storage taxonomy (`src/cadrumo/core/storage_taxonomy.py`),"
" [analysis](../articles/118-live-access-policy-corpus-integrity-and-"
"decimal-contracts.md)."
msgstr ""
"La exportación portátil en texto claro es una elección explícita de "
"destino local. La telemetría está desactivada por defecto; las edades "
"declaradas de conservación no son limpieza impuesta automáticamente. "
"[Custodia](../topics/operations-profiles-and-workflows.md), taxonomía de "
"almacenamiento (`src/cadrumo/core/storage_taxonomy.py`), "
"[análisis](../articles/118-live-access-policy-corpus-integrity-and-"
"decimal-contracts.md)."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md:27
msgid ""
"Several important functions are **explicitly unsupported or refused**. "
"The core live-access gate raises for outbound submission, and the "
"workflow engine records `submission_id=None`; the supported path produces"
" files for a human to upload through AEAT. The inbound censal certificate"
" parser refuses pending a specimen-backed layout, while live censal "
"read/review is a separate implemented path. The local apoderado "
"configuration surface exists, but live representation verification is "
"unwired. M145 is a payer communication, not an AEAT filing; Modelo 721 "
"registry applicability does not by itself imply a complete filing "
"service. These refusals should remain visible when describing breadth "
"rather than being hidden behind a count of model schemas or commands. No-"
"submit gate (`src/cadrumo/core/access_gate/gate.py`), local workflow "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`), censal parser "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/inbound/censo/parser.py`), apoderado "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/auth/apoderado_service.py`), M145 "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/m145_communication.py`), "
"[analyses](../articles/118-live-access-policy-corpus-integrity-and-"
"decimal-contracts.md), [037](../articles/037-authentication-certificate-"
"sources-and-diagnostic-privacy.md)."
msgstr ""
"Varias funciones importantes están **expresamente no admitidas o "
"rechazadas**. El control central de acceso en vivo genera un error para "
"presentación saliente y el motor de flujos registra `submission_id=None`;"
" la ruta admitida produce archivos para que una persona los cargue "
"mediante la AEAT. El analizador de entrada de certificados censales "
"rechaza mientras no exista un diseño respaldado por ejemplares, mientras "
"que la lectura y revisión censal en vivo es una ruta implementada "
"separada. Existe la superficie local de configuración de apoderados, pero"
" la verificación de representación en vivo no está conectada. M145 es una"
" comunicación al pagador, no una presentación ante la AEAT; la "
"aplicabilidad del Modelo 721 en el registro no implica por sí sola un "
"servicio completo de presentación. Estos rechazos deben seguir visibles "
"al describir la amplitud, en lugar de ocultarse tras un recuento de "
"esquemas de modelos o comandos. Control que impide presentar "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/access_gate/gate.py`), flujo local "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/workflow/engine.py`), analizador censal "
"(`src/cadrumo/adapters/inbound/censo/parser.py`), apoderado "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/auth/apoderado_service.py`), M145 "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/m145_communication.py`), "
"[análisis](../articles/118-live-access-policy-corpus-integrity-and-"
"decimal-contracts.md), [037](../articles/037-authentication-certificate-"
"sources-and-diagnostic-privacy.md)."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md:29
msgid ""
"A typical end-to-end journey therefore starts by proving access to one "
"profile and reviewing its setup, imports transactions or invoices with "
"provenance, resolves evidence and classification, creates a Modelo work "
"unit for one period, calculates a draft from pinned sources, and verifies"
" the exact revision. The operator can then produce a local official-"
"layout file and upload it through AEAT outside Cadrumo. Later, "
"authenticated read/capture and receipt reconciliation may establish "
"whether the external system recorded that return. At any point, an "
"incomplete profile, stale ledger, missing casilla, unsupported producer, "
"absent live session or ambiguous receipt can stop promotion to the next "
"grade. The product has useful read-only inspection paths at many of those"
" stops; those paths should be described as guidance, not as a completed "
"filing. Preparation "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/_calculation_preparation.py`), "
"verification (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/verification_actions.py`), "
"local artifact (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/export.py`), "
"reconciliation "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/filing_chain_reconciliation.py`), [full "
"topic](../topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md)."
msgstr ""
"Por tanto, un recorrido típico de extremo a extremo comienza acreditando "
"acceso a un perfil y revisando su configuración, importa transacciones o "
"facturas con procedencia, resuelve evidencias y clasificación, crea una "
"unidad de trabajo de modelo para un período, calcula un borrador desde "
"fuentes fijadas y verifica la revisión exacta. El operador puede producir"
" después un archivo local de diseño oficial y cargarlo mediante la AEAT "
"fuera de Cadrumo. Más tarde, la lectura y captura autenticadas y la "
"conciliación de justificantes pueden establecer si el sistema externo "
"registró esa declaración. En cualquier punto, un perfil incompleto, libro"
" contable obsoleto, casilla ausente, productor no admitido, sesión en "
"vivo ausente o justificante ambiguo puede detener la promoción al "
"siguiente grado. El producto tiene rutas útiles de inspección de solo "
"lectura en muchas de esas paradas; deben describirse como orientación, no"
" como declaración completada. Preparación "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/_calculation_preparation.py`), "
"verificación (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/verification_actions.py`), "
"artefacto local (`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/export.py`), "
"conciliación "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/modelo/filing_chain_reconciliation.py`), [tema "
"completo](../topics/modelo-work-and-revision-lifecycle-part-1.md)."

#: ../../technical/assessments/product-capability-map.md:31
msgid ""
"The knowledge bundle has 58 model identifiers and 68 named revisions in "
"2,140 registry files, alongside official artefacts, manuals, normative "
"text, examples, terminology and four locale trees. This is strong "
"evidence of authored scope, not evidence that every model has complete "
"live producers or a current accepted export. The declared year policy has"
" a 2022 floor and 2026 advisory horizon, and the 2026 Modelo 303 revision"
" candidly lacks a fresh-render reproduction and legal attestation. The "
"source review was representative for large assets and did not perform "
"current-law validation, live AEAT transactions or product tests. Read "
"each capability together with its specific source, registry revision and "
"evidence grade. [Bundle](../topics/bundled-knowledge-and-"
"localization.md), year policy (`src/cadrumo/_data/registry/aeat/legal"
"/supported-filing-years.toml`), 303 note "
"(`src/cadrumo/_data/registry/aeat/modelos/303/revisions/2026-y-siguientes/revision.toml`),"
" [analysis](../articles/203-aeat-registry-and-model-declarations.md)."
msgstr ""
"El paquete de conocimiento tiene 58 identificadores de modelos y 68 "
"revisiones con nombre en 2,140 archivos del registro, junto con "
"artefactos oficiales, manuales, texto normativo, ejemplos, terminología y"
" cuatro árboles de idiomas. Es una evidencia sólida del alcance definido,"
" no evidencia de que cada modelo tenga productores activos completos o "
"una exportación actualmente aceptada. La política declarada de ejercicios"
" tiene un mínimo de 2022 y un horizonte orientativo de 2026, y la "
"revisión de 2026 del Modelo 303 carece explícitamente de reproducción "
"mediante nueva representación y atestación jurídica. La revisión de "
"fuentes fue representativa para recursos grandes y no realizó validación "
"de legislación vigente, transacciones en vivo de la AEAT ni pruebas del "
"producto. Lee cada capacidad junto con su fuente específica, revisión del"
" registro y grado de evidencias. [Paquete](../topics/bundled-knowledge-"
"and-localization.md), política de ejercicios "
"(`src/cadrumo/_data/registry/aeat/legal/supported-filing-years.toml`), "
"nota de 303 "
"(`src/cadrumo/_data/registry/aeat/modelos/303/revisions/2026-y-siguientes/revision.toml`),"
" [análisis](../articles/203-aeat-registry-and-model-declarations.md)."
